{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01C7k5JjxzLDMZ3q2PjkuHzz","type":"tool_result","content":"# Total Farmers Markets in the U.S.\n\nSumming all values in the \"farmers_markets\" column across all states and territories, the dataset shows **8,668 total farmers markets**.\n\nThis figure includes all 50 states plus Washington D.C., Puerto Rico, and the Virgin Islands. California leads with 647 markets, followed by New York with 555 and Pennsylvania with 426."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c8f02d97-868c-4296-b186-e843f30ec765","uuid":"478dd2ac-6134-4cd6-9ee4-405f83e0e176","timestamp":"2026-08-16T20:46:51.579Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":2651,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# Total Farmers Markets in the U.S.\n\nSumming all values in the \"farmers_markets\" column across all states and territories, the dataset shows **8,668 total farmers markets**.\n\nThis figure includes all 50 states plus Washington D.C., Puerto Rico, and the Virgin Islands. California leads with 647 markets, followed by New York with 555 and Pennsylvania with 426.","durationMs":1674,"url":"https://harvestlymarkets.com/data/us-farmers-markets-by-state-2026.csv"}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017VyqJNP4yEgL8yJdNrs6Wn","type":"tool_result","content":"# U.S. Population from Census Data\n\nBased on the census data provided, the total U.S. population figures are:\n\n- **2020 Census Base**: 331,516,113\n- **2020 Estimate**: 331,578,104\n- **2025 Estimate**: 341,784,857\n\nThe data shows \"POPESTIMATE2020,331578104\" for the United States entry, representing the official population estimate for that year. The figures reflect steady growth over the five-year period, with approximately 10.2 million added to the U.S. population between 2020 and 2025."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c8f02d97-868c-4296-b186-e843f30ec765","uuid":"486af8a5-849e-4168-bd12-88e262620935","timestamp":"2026-08-16T20:46:52.921Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":53555,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# U.S. Population from Census Data\n\nBased on the census data provided, the total U.S. population figures are:\n\n- **2020 Census Base**: 331,516,113\n- **2020 Estimate**: 331,578,104\n- **2025 Estimate**: 341,784,857\n\nThe data shows \"POPESTIMATE2020,331578104\" for the United States entry, representing the official population estimate for that year. The figures reflect steady growth over the five-year period, with approximately 10.2 million added to the U.S. population between 2020 and 2025.","durationMs":2403,"url":"https://gist.githubusercontent.com/hussainsultan/369600f5179b22792a2b4c9ed37de056/raw/NST-EST2025-ALLDATA.csv"}}
